materialdesignicons-webfont.ttf and mdi-codepoints.json
-------------------------------------------------------

Material Design Icons, version 7.4.47, from

    https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign-Webfont

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The font file is unmodified. mdi-codepoints.json is generated from that
project's scss/_variables.scss by scripts/fetch_mdi_assets.py; it holds
nothing but the icon names and the glyph positions they live at, which is
what lets an "icon" element in a payload be written as "mdi:battery-50".

Both files are bundled so that drawing an icon never needs the network.
